          },
          "metadata": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        " City B generates the highest TOTAL revenue (₹2.12B) because it\n",
        " has the most transactions (231,173). But City C has the highest AVERAGE\n",
        " purchase per transaction (₹9,720) — fewer transactions, but people spend more each time there.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "gSMbC9g7Hjwx"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        " 6. Does \"years lived in current city\" affect spending — do newcomers spend differently than long-term residents?"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "0R7NBhEqH1fu"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "stay_order = ['0', '1', '2', '3', '4+']\n",
        "stay_summary = data.groupby('Stay_In_Current_City_Years')['Purchase'].agg(['mean', 'sum', 'count']).reindex(stay_order)\n",
        "stay_summary\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.figure(figsize=(8, 5))\n",
        "sns.barplot(x=stay_summary.index, y=stay_summary['mean'], order=stay_order)\n",
        "plt.title('Average Purchase by Years in Current City')\n",
        "plt.xlabel('Years in Current City')\n",
        "plt.ylabel('Average Purchase')\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 524
        },
