        "# Summary\n",
        "Dataset: 550,068 Black Friday transactions, 12 columns (demographics, product categories, purchase amount). No duplicates; only real gaps were in Product_Category_2/3, filled with 0 since they mean \"no category assigned,\" not missing data.\n",
